        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "For Part-time employees promoted to Full-time status after June 23, 2002, they will be informed that a condition of Full-time employment for them is the four day, ten hour straight-time shift and that if the company abandons such shifts, they remain at Full-time status with a five day, eight hour shift.",
            "block_bbox": [
