        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "19.15 Part time employees, except those who are available on a limited basis, will be scheduled for no less than sixteen (16) hours per week and four (4) hours per day, provided they are available on a regular and continuing basis and further provided that they are available to work the Employer's schedule of hours and there is no drop in business.",
